ubparagraph (4A)(c)(iii)\".* >> >> *5 Application of amendments* >> >>> *The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to licences regardless of when the licences were issued.* >> >> *Part 2 — Repeals* >> >> *[Australian Communications and Media Authority (Community Television) Direction 2020](https://www.legislation.gov.au/Details/F2020L00847/Explana","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7303","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2021-06-22/35"}
